// Local Xcode signing/build settings for the Qontract iOS target.
//
// This file is committed with EMPTY defaults on purpose. Fill in your values
// locally before building; treat the filled-in values as machine/local state
// (do not push your personal team id / credentials to the remote).
//
//   DEVELOPMENT_TEAM — your 10-character Apple Developer team id, e.g.
//                      DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCD1234EF
//                      Leave empty to use the Xcode account's default team.
//
// Signing is automatic (CODE_SIGN_STYLE=Automatic in the project), so Xcode
// resolves the App Store / Ad-Hoc certificate + provisioning profile for
// this team and the Runner bundle id automatically.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
